<p>Iran executed three men on Thursday after detaining them during anti-government protests in January, in what multiple outlets described as the first executions linked to those demonstrations. Iranian authorities said the men were accused of killing police officers during the unrest, while rights groups said the case was marred by coerced confessions, torture allegations, and the lack of a fair trial. The executions add a grave new dimension to Iran&#x27;s response to the January protests, which had already drawn scrutiny over the treatment of detainees. Activists cited in the reporting warned that the hangings could signal a broader increase in executions as war continues with Israel and the United States.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Teen athlete: Rights groups said one of the three men was a teenager and an internationally competitive wrestler.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/03/19/iran-hangs-three-men-in-first-executions-over-january-anti-government-protests'>Iran hangs three men in first executions over January anti-government protests</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/iran-executes-three-men-detained-during-january-protests/article70761060.ece'>Iran executes three men detained during January protests</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/iran-hangs-three-men-first-executions-over-january-protests'>Iran hangs three men in first executions over January protests</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/iran-executes-three-individuals-arrested-over-january-protests-state-media-2026-03-19/'>Iran executes three men arrested during protests last January.</a> - reuters.com</li></ul>